          "title": "Maximum of two rent increase increments per 12 months for the same tenant",
          "requirement": "If the same tenant remains in occupancy of a covered unit over any 12-month period, the gross rental rate may not be increased in more than two increments over that period, subject to the other restrictions of subdivision (a).",
